	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r12r0101_oldman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まごが　さいしょに　であう
ポケモンは　なにがいいか　まようの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>孫が　最初に　出会う
ポケモンは　なにがいいか　迷うの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r12r0101_babygirl1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おじいちゃんに　ポケモンを
つかまえて　もらうんだ！▼
ポケモンと　なかよくなって
いつか　イッシュを　めぐるの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おじいちゃんに　ポケモンを
つかまえて　もらうんだ！▼
ポケモンと　なかよくなって
いつか　イッシュを　めぐるの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
